        "TileImage": "$($repository d9f7907e-dcd1-469f-9fd1-b1f500e3d015).Image",
        "Description": "The files from Theron&apos;s company show a suspicious amount guns being sold to a pair of brothers known as Lava and Kusha, who run a deep criminal network through  western asia. Rahul, or Lava, does most of the heavy lifting while Vivek prefers not to get his hands dirty. We believe they are the ones behind the attacks on the ICA as one of our possible clients came to us to attempt to stop a terror attack in Miami. They did&apos;t want us interfering.",
